      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<p class=\"p1\"><em>\u2018Aden</em>:\u00a0It is a town in Yemen, situated to the south, outside, on the seashore. It has two gates\u2014one opening to the land and the other to the sea\u2014so that it appears almost like the wall of a fortress. It is attributed to a man named <em>Ebyen</em>, and from ancient times it has been known as <em>\u2018Aden-i Ebyen</em> (\u201cAden of Ebyen\u201d). [translation]</p>",
